ail messages using the token "abc123token"? Please, get messages starting from "2026-05-01" and ending on "2026-05-17".\nassistant: Sure! I\'ll handle all four tasks for you right away — generating the QR code, fetching the story details, pulling the latest politics headlines, and retrieving your emails within the specified date range.\nuser: Perfect! Can you now download the QR code image and save it as \'project_qr.png\' in the \'reports\' folder? Also, please summarize the story details and the top politics headline into a single brief report.\nassistant: Downloading the QR code and saving it to the reports folder. Meanwhile, I’ll extract and summarize the story and top headline for your report.\nuser: Thanks! Now, please compile everything into a single PDF report: include the QR code, the story summary, the headline summary, and list the two latest email subjects. Name the file \'project_summary.pdf\'.\nassistant: Compiling all elements into a single PDF report titled \'project_summary.pdf\' — including the QR code, summaries, and email subjects.\nuser: What is graphene and what are its possible applications and characteristics?<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=2000, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None), prompt_token_ids: None, lora_request: None, prompt_adapter_request: None.
